# The baseline: nothing changed but logging. Every other knob file is compared with this one.
#
# A knob file is sourced by scripts/spike/run.sh (`set -a; . FILE`) into the application's
# environment only; the streamer and the spike tools never see it. One KEY=VALUE per line.
#
# QSG_INFO=1 makes Qt Quick print the scene-graph backend and the GL renderer it chose at
# start-up, into the run's app.log. It changes nothing else
# (https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qtquick-visualcanvas-scenegraph-renderer.html, checked 2026-09-23).
QSG_INFO=1
